<LegalPage title="About Us" seoTitle="About Us | 5 Letter Words Free Word Finder Tools" description="Learn who is behind 5 Letter Words, the free word finder, Wordle solver and unscrambler for Wordle, Scrabble, crosswords and other word games.">
  <p>5 Letter Words is a free set of word-finding tools for people who love word games. Our finders for three- to seven-letter words, the Wordle solver, the word unscrambler and the anagram solver are built to be fast, clear and easy to use on any device.</p>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>You give the tools the clues you have — letters in the right place, letters in the wrong place, letters ruled out, or the tiles on your rack — and they show every word that fits. We never hide the answer from you: the aim is a useful shortlist, not a spoiler.</p>
  <h2>Our word lists</h2>
  <p>Word counts and dictionaries are published openly on each page. Games accept different words, so we recommend checking a word against your own game when it matters.</p>
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections or ideas? Visit our <a href="/contact-us">contact page</a>.</p>
